# Kingsfield Doesn't Teach My Contracts Class: Using Contracts To Teach Contracts.

**Authors:** Warkentine, Edith R.

## Abstract
A law school professor describes her approach to teaching Contracts through the analysis of actual contracts instead of through case briefings. Considered are educational objectives of the Contracts course; the five discrete methods commonly used to teach Contracts; why the author's approach is more successful in integrating theory doctrine, and practice; and specific classroom exercises. (DB)

